    {
      "id": "claim_a6f974fc27ad4e679dacd10fbe05b76e",
      "statement": "Allowance_Summary weights the scenario ECLs with Scenarios!B6:B8 (20% Upside, 50% Baseline, 30% Downside) via E6 =B6*Scenarios!$B$6+C6*Scenarios!$B$7+D6*Scenarios!$B$8, giving a modeled total of 15,238.91 $mm in E12; the weight-sum check at Scenarios!C9 is a flag only and is not referenced by the summary formulas, so a failing weight set would not block the calculation.",
